   "elements": [
    {
     "id": "f02cc13e",
     "elType": "widget",
     "widgetType": "html",
     "settings": {
      "html": "<section class=\"band--cream\" data-el=\"page.blocks\" data-el-build=\"elementor\">\n  <div class=\"wrap section\">\n    <h2 class=\"h2 mb-l reveal\" style=\"max-width:26ch\">What review covers.</h2>\n    <div class=\"hairline\" style=\"--min:260px\" data-stagger>\n      <div class=\"cell\" style=\"min-height:240px;padding:34px 28px 38px\"><span class=\"num\">01</span><h3 class=\"h3\">Qualification and registration</h3><p style=\"font-size:15.5px\">Regulated professions must evidence current licence or registration. Those fields are conditional and only appear where they apply.</p></div><div class=\"cell\" style=\"min-height:240px;padding:34px 28px 38px\"><span class=\"num\">02</span><h3 class=\"h3\">Insurance and safeguarding</h3><p style=\"font-size:15.5px\">Professional indemnity, screening and safeguarding arrangements are checked before any participant contact.</p></div><div class=\"cell\" style=\"min-height:240px;padding:34px 28px 38px\"><span class=\"num\">03</span><h3 class=\"h3\">Capacity and coverage</h3><p style=\"font-size:15.5px\">Age groups, specialisation, geography and delivery mode, so referrals are only made where a provider can genuinely take them.</p></div><div class=\"cell\" style=\"min-height:240px;padding:34px 28px 38px\"><span class=\"num\">04</span><h3 class=\"h3\">Agreement and listing</h3><p style=\"font-size:15.5px\">Listing follows a signed agreement. Until then a submission sits in a review queue with an auditable status.</p></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>"
     },
     "elements": []
    }
   ]
  },
